<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-quaternary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-13" style="text-transform:uppercase">Recruit me</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Are you a student athlete looking to continue your athletic journey?</strong> Jackson College offers a dynamic environment where you can excel both academically and athletically. If you&#8217;re ready to compete at the collegiate level, we want to hear from you!</p>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
